1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,728
Seventeen percent of U.S. teens say they
often or sometimes can't finish homework

2
00:00:05,778 --> 00:00:09,283
because they lack reliable computer or
internet access.

3
00:00:09,333 --> 00:00:11,950
That's from Pew Research Center, 2018.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,397
ShareSafe Practice is fractions practice
for students like Maya, a seventh grader
on

5
00:00:16,447 --> 00:00:19,476
a library computer with an old phone at
home.

6
00:00:19,526 --> 00:00:24,608
No account, no name, and nothing saved
after she closes the tab, unless she
chooses

7
00:00:24,658 --> 00:00:24,950
to.

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,424
Everything works from the keyboard.

9
00:00:29,474 --> 00:00:33,897
Start with a six-question pre-check.

10
00:00:33,947 --> 00:00:41,950
No hints here, it just shows where you
begin.

11
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:51,950
In practice, every problem has three hints
that build step by step, a fraction bar

12
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,283
model, and full worked steps.

13
00:00:55,333 --> 00:01:03,283
The method follows OpenStax Prealgebra,
but every problem is original and
generated

14
00:01:03,333 --> 00:01:07,950
by code, so there's always another one.

15
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:15,318
Students can make the text bigger, switch
to high contrast, or turn on plain

16
00:01:15,368 --> 00:01:20,582
language, which rewrites every instruction
and hint in simpler words.

17
00:01:20,632 --> 00:01:27,950
Read aloud speaks the problem, and screen
readers hear fractions as three over four.

18
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:35,807
Before leaving the library, Maya gets her
resume code, or scans the QR with her

19
00:01:35,857 --> 00:01:36,331
phone.

20
00:01:36,381 --> 00:01:41,569
Her progress moves over with no account
and no server.

21
00:01:41,619 --> 00:01:44,712
The last two characters catch typos.

22
00:01:44,762 --> 00:01:49,950
They don't stop forgery, and the app says
so honestly.

23
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:58,814
The whole app is about eighteen kilobytes
and is cached after one visit.

24
00:01:58,864 --> 00:02:04,950
So at home, with no internet, it still
works.

25
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:12,298
On the shared computer, End session wipes
everything the app stored, including the

26
00:02:12,348 --> 00:02:17,950
offline copy if she wants, and confirms
what it removed.

27
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:20,719
Then the post-check shows her growth.

28
00:02:20,769 --> 00:02:26,719
Lighthouse scores a hundred in every
category, axe finds no violations, and
real

29
00:02:26,769 --> 00:02:29,027
screen reader testing is next.

30
00:02:29,077 --> 00:02:29,950
ShareSafe Practice.
